# What never needs to reach the daemon.
#
# Without this the context is 136 MB, of which 109 MB is output: a 42 MB
# checkpoint the image deliberately does not carry, and two build directories
# from whatever was compiled here last. All of it copied on every build, and the
# checkpoint in particular is the exact file the Dockerfile explains it is not
# shipping.

# Build output, on both sides.
build/
build-*/
third_party/**/build/
third_party/**/build-*/

# The checkpoint. Reproducible from a seed by braid_train, and mounted at
# runtime rather than baked in -- see the Dockerfile's header.
models/

# History, tooling, and the parts of the repository an image has no use for.
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.gitmodules
docs/
bench/
README.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# Go's own caches, if anyone has run a build outside a container.
**/*.exe
**/*.test
**/testdata/fuzz/
